  "findings": [
    "L_g = sum g_v L_v has a STRUCTURED 4-mode imaginary spectrum (4 distinct |eig|, conjugate pairs) \u2014 the species fingerprint is the DISTRIBUTION, not a single number.",
    "Quadratic invariant is ~fixed: sum(mode^2) ~ 4|g|^2 (abs defect <= 7.4e-05) \u2014 the spectral 'energy' is pinned by |g|, only its split across modes is species-structural.",
    "This Fano gate table is NOT a clean Clifford rep (||L_g^2+|g|^2 I||_F up to 2.7e-03), which is exactly why a single carrier already resolves channels.",
    "Overall scale 1/|g| spans 30.6..46.6 \u2014 near the GUT coupling ~42, NOT 137. CODATA 1/137 is a dressed/run value, not an algebraic invariant of these matrices.",
    "Frame-independent per-species readouts that DO emerge: 1/|g| (overall coupling, monotone with mass) and the spectral spread mode_max/mode_min (~10, weakly species-dep)."
  ]
